WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'uncore_get_attr_cpumask' to 'cpumask_show'
#78: FILE: arch/x86/kernel/cpu/perf_event_intel_uncore.c:2352:
